contentText:
Miley Cyrus is channeling Dolly Parton &#8216;s light as she reacts to their new Grammy nomination on behalf of them both.

Shortly after the 2027 Grammy nominations went live on Monday (Nov. 16), revealing that the late Queen of Country and her famous goddaughter are up for best country duo/group performance &#8212; alongside Lainey Wilson, Queen Latifah and Reba McEntire for their collective cover of &#8220;Light of a Clear Blue Morning&#8221; &#8212; Cyrus shared a black-and-white photo of a New Harvest &#8230; First Gathering vinyl on Instagram . The album was released by Parton in 1976 and featured the original version of the song on the tracklist.

